@segment 24-26 Darkshore, Cat Form, Ashenvale I & Stonetalon
@start-level 24
# Skyborne Druid. Same quests, order and flight paths as the Dwarf original (Dwarf segment 08), plus the Cat Form chain.
# First Kalimdor trip. Carried through untouched: 57, 67, 157, 181, 240, 453 (segment 11) and 275, 295, 471 (segment 10).
# Carry-out adds 1026 (Raene's Cleansing, the rod: segment 13).
# Hearth: Menethil Harbor on arrival, Auberdine for the Cat Form trip, Astranaar from Astranaar on.
# Changes from the Dwarf original:
# - The Dwarf's class quests removed (94500, filling the Blue Waterskin). The only travel that disappeared is the few steps from
#   Astranaar down to the lake shore; Astranaar itself is the quest hub of this segment and stays.
# - Cat Form chain added right after arriving in Auberdine (source: ForeverChanges Cat Form guide and quest pages; the
#   guide's author had not finished the chain): boat Auberdine -> Rut'theran Village (flight path), portal to
#   Darnassus, Mathrengyl Bearwalker (98393, and level 24 training), Teleport: Moonglade, Dendrite Starblaze (98393,
#   98341), Avatar of Saeyleenan (98341, 98404, 98738), Stormrage Barrow Dens, Dendrite (98738, 98397), back to
#   Mathrengyl (98397: he teaches Cat Form, Prowl, Claw and Rip), boat back to Auberdine.
#   Way back from Moonglade: the druid flight master Silva Fil'naveth (Moonglade 44.2, 45.2) to Rut'theran Village.
#   That is Classic knowledge, not re-checked in Forever. Fallback: the Hearthstone. On arrival it is still bound in
#   Menethil Harbor, on the other continent, so this segment adds a bind in Auberdine before the trip (extra bind,
#   not in the Dwarf original; Menethil is not hearthed to in this segment and Astranaar replaces the bind later
#   anyway). Segment 8 does not use the Hearthstone after Thelsamar, so it is ready here.
# - Training: Mathrengyl in Darnassus at the start (level 24). At Stonetalon Peak the druid casts Teleport: Moonglade
#   (Loganaar, level 26 spells) and takes the Hearthstone back to Astranaar. That replaces the Stonetalon Peak ->
#   Astranaar flight (whose fallback was the Hearthstone anyway); the Stonetalon Peak flight path is still picked up.
#   The Hearthstone was last used, at most, during the Cat Form trip at the start of the segment, hours earlier.
# - No travel form below level 30: the long road stretches are walked; the pendant east of Mystral Lake is fetched
#   in Cat Form with Prowl.
# Left out on purpose: 731 and 908 (elite), 1199 / 1198 / 1275 / 1200 / 971 (Blackfathom Deeps), 1072 / 1075 / 1094 (they send
# you to Ironforge, Stormwind or Ratchet), 1057, and the quests kept for segment 13 (1035, 1011/1012, 1021/1031, 1022,
# 4581, 98417/98418, 86757, 1027-1046), the Darnassus hand-ins (1081, 741, 3765).
@carry 57,67,157,161,181,240,275,295,453,471,93963,97894

# ---------- Auberdine ----------
F Auberdine @ Darkshore, 36.3, 45.6 | Walk off the dock into Auberdine. Caylais Moonfeather, the hippogryph master, stands at the foot of the dock.
T 97894 @ Darkshore, 38.1, 41.2 | Gorbold Steelhand, at a merchant stall in Auberdine: the message from his brother in Stormwind
A 729 | Archaeologist Hollee, the dwarf in the north part of the village
A 965 | Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze, in the building on the east side of the village

# ---------- Cat Form: Darnassus and Moonglade ----------
S Auberdine @ Darkshore, 37.0, 44.1 | Innkeeper Shaussiy, in the inn at the head of the docks. This bind is your way back if the Moonglade flight below does not exist.
N Take the boat from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village | Check on the dock which boat it is: one pier goes to Rut'theran Village (Darnassus), the other to Menethil Harbor.
F Rut'theran Village @ Teldrassil, 58.4, 94.0 | Vesprystus, the hippogryph master, close to the dock
N Walk through the glowing portal in Rut'theran Village up to Darnassus | The Cenarion Enclave is in the north-west of the city.
A 98393 @ Darnassus, 35.2, 8.0 | Mathrengyl Bearwalker, the druid trainer in the Cenarion Enclave: The Great Cat Spirit (new in Forever, from level 20)
TRAIN @ Darnassus, 35.2, 8.0 | Mathrengyl Bearwalker: learn everything up to your level (Remove Curse at 24). Take any other class quest he offers.
C 93963:4 @ Darnassus, 39.1, 81.6 | Exploring the Alliance: Tyrande Whisperwind stands on the upper floor of the Temple of the Moon, in the south of the city. Talk to her, then come back north for the teleport
N Cast Teleport: Moonglade | You land in Nighthaven.
T 98393 @ Moonglade, 56.2, 30.6 | Dendrite Starblaze, in Nighthaven
A 98341 @ Moonglade, 56.2, 30.6 | Dendrite Starblaze: The Great Windborne Cat Spirit
T 98341 @ Moonglade, 44.0, 73.5 | Go south across the lake by the twin bridges. The Avatar of Saeyleenan stands south of them.
A 98404 @ Moonglade, 44.0, 73.5 | Avatar of Saeyleenan
C 98404 @ Moonglade, 71.2, 61.5 | The Stormrage Barrow Dens are east of the lake; this is the door. Click the statue in front of the door first: it hides you for five minutes while you stay out of combat. Inside pick up the Relic of the Fang, the Relic of the Claw and the Relic of the Silent Shadow. They lie a few steps apart, the last one at the foot of a white cat statue. If a spirit sees you, go Bear Form and fight it.
T 98404 @ Moonglade, 44.0, 73.5 | Back to the Avatar of Saeyleenan
A 98738 @ Moonglade, 44.0, 73.5 | Avatar of Saeyleenan
T 98738 @ Moonglade, 56.2, 30.6 | Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven
A 98397 @ Moonglade, 56.2, 30.6 | Dendrite Starblaze: To Darnassus. As far as is known this is the last quest of the chain. Loganaar, the trainer, stands close by (52.5, 40.6) if you missed a spell.
N Fly from Nighthaven to Rut'theran Village | Silva Fil'naveth, the druids' flight master, stands on the west side of Nighthaven (Moonglade 44.2, 45.2). Classic knowledge, not checked for Forever. If she offers no flight: use your Hearthstone (Auberdine) and take the boat to Rut'theran Village again.
T 98397 @ Darnassus, 35.2, 8.0 | Through the portal up to Darnassus: Mathrengyl Bearwalker. He teaches Cat Form, Prowl, Claw and Rip. Take any follow-up he offers.
N Take the boat from Rut'theran Village back to Auberdine | Down through the portal to the dock. From here on you have Cat Form.

# ---------- Tower of Althalaxx ----------
T 965 | Follow the road north out of Auberdine and turn east where the land rises toward the Tower of Althalaxx. Balthule Shadowstrike hides below the tower (55.0, 24.9).
A 966 | Balthule Shadowstrike
C 966 | Dark Strand Fanatics (16-17) camp around the tower: kill them for 4 Worn Parchments. They are far below you. Do not climb the tower: Athrikus Narassin (31) is at the top.
T 966 | Balthule Shadowstrike
A 967 | Balthule Shadowstrike. A letter for Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.

# ---------- South along the road ----------
T 729 | Run back past Auberdine and take the road south, a long way. Near the south end of Darkshore leave the road to the west: Prospector Remtravel stands in his dig (35.7, 83.7). Do not take his escort (elite).
A 945 | Therylune is in the Master's Glaive, the ruin just south-east of the dig (38.6, 87.3). Kill the cultists around her first.
C 945 @ Darkshore, 38.6, 87.3 | Escort: walk with Therylune until she is out of the Master's Glaive. Stay ahead of her and kill what attacks; everything here is far below you.
A 5321 | Go north-east to the Grove of the Ancients, beside the road (44.4, 76.4). Kerlonian Evershade sleeps there.
C 5321 | Take the Horn of Awakening out of Kerlonian's Chest next to him, then escort Kerlonian south along the road. He follows you and keeps falling asleep: use the Horn of Awakening on him each time. Stay on the road and walk beside him. Changed in Forever: the objective now reads "escort Kerlonian on the road south to his bag", still in Darkshore, so the escort part may end before Ashenvale. The hand-in is still listed at Maestra's Post.

# ---------- Maestra's Post ----------
T 5321 | Maestra's Post is the first camp on the road inside Ashenvale. Liladris Moonriver stands at its north end (27.3, 35.6).
T 967 | Delgren the Purifier, in the camp (26.2, 38.7)
A 970 | Delgren the Purifier
A 1010 | Orendil Broadleaf, next to him
C 970 @ Ashenvale, 31.3, 30.8 | The Dark Strand cultists dig in the ruins north-east of Maestra's Post (around 31, 31). Kill Cultists, Adepts, Excavators (18-20) and the Enforcer until one drops the Glowing Soul Gem.
C 1010 @ Ashenvale, 31.7, 23.0 | Bathran's Haunt is further north (around 32, 23). Pick 5 Bathran's Hair from the Plant Bundles on the ground between the Forsaken there (18-20).
T 1010 | Back at Maestra's Post: Orendil Broadleaf
A 1020 | Orendil Broadleaf. His cure goes to Astranaar.
T 970 | Delgren the Purifier
A 973 | Delgren the Purifier

# ---------- Shrine of Aessina and Fire Scar Shrine ----------
T 945 | Go south from Maestra's Post, across the road. Therysil stands at the Shrine of Aessina (22.6, 51.9).
C 973 | Fire Scar Shrine is just south of the Shrine of Aessina. Ilkrud Magthrull (24) stands in the middle of it (25.3, 60.7) with Felslayers (22-23) all around. Clear a path of Felslayers one at a time (they drain mana: fight them in Cat or Bear Form), then fight Ilkrud with full mana: Bash (Bear Form) stops a Shadow Bolt, and Entangling Roots holds whatever he calls. He drops Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome. You hand it in when you pass Maestra's Post again.

# ---------- Astranaar ----------
F Astranaar @ Ashenvale, 34.4, 48.0 | Go back north to the road and follow it east to Astranaar, the town on the island in the lake. Daelyshia, the hippogryph master, stands at the west entrance.
S Astranaar @ Ashenvale, 37.0, 49.2 | Innkeeper Kimlya in the inn
A 1008 | Shindrell Swiftfire, near the west entrance
A 991 | Raene Wolfrunner, in the building in the middle of town
T 1020 | Pelturas Whitemoon, in the house at the south-east end of town
A 1033 | Pelturas Whitemoon

# ---------- Lake Falathim and the Zoram Strand ----------
T 991 | Take the road west out of Astranaar and leave it to the north-west for Lake Falathim. Teronis' Corpse lies at the lake (20.3, 42.3).
A 1023 | From Teronis' Corpse
C 1023 | Saltspittle murlocs (19-21) around the lake: kill them until one drops the Glowing Gem.
A 1007 | Keep north-west to the coast. Talen camps above the Zoram Strand (14.8, 31.3). The Horde has a camp on the shore south-west of him (Classic knowledge, not checked for Forever): stay away from its guards.
C 1007 | The Ancient Statuette lies on the strand north of Talen (14.2, 20.6). Fight your way there through the Wrathtail naga and count their heads.
T 1007 | Talen
A 1009 | Talen
C 1009,1008 @ Ashenvale, 9.0, 18.0 | Kill naga along the strand until you have 20 Wrathtail Heads: Wave Riders and Sorceresses (18-19) on the near side, Razortails and Sea Witches (19-20) further out, Myrmidons and Priestesses (20-21) at the north end. Ruuzel (22) stands with her guards on the small island at the north end (7.2, 13.1): pull the guards one at a time with Wrath from maximum range, then kill her for the Ring of Zoram. Bash the casters' heals and bolts. Lady Vespia, a rare elite who walks the strand, also carries the ring: leave her unless she is alone and you are at full health.
T 1009 | Talen

# ---------- Maestra's Post again ----------
T 973 | Walk back east to Maestra's Post: Delgren the Purifier
A 976 | Feero Ironhand, standing next to Delgren. This starts an escort with three ambushes.
C 976 @ Ashenvale, 26.2, 38.9 | Walk with Feero. Three groups attack one after the other, the last one the strongest. Eat and drink to full before you talk to him, put Rejuvenation on yourself and go Bear Form at the start of each ambush (Demoralizing Roar, Swipe), kill the casters first with Bash on their casts, and heal between waves. Feero fights too, but he must survive.
T 976 | Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post

# ---------- Astranaar hand-ins ----------
T 1008 | Back along the road to Astranaar: Shindrell Swiftfire
A 1134 | Shindrell Swiftfire. The wyverns are in Stonetalon, later in this segment.
T 1023 | Raene Wolfrunner
A 1024,1025,1054 | Raene Wolfrunner
A 1070 | Sentinel Thenysil, on the west side of town
A 1056 | Faldreas Goeth'Shael, near Raene's building

# ---------- North and east of Astranaar ----------
C 1054 | Thistlefur Village is in the hills north of Astranaar. Dal Bloodclaw (25) stands at 37.7, 34.7 among Thistlefur furbolgs (23-24), many of them Thistlefur Shamans, who heal. Pull single furbolgs on the way in, Bash their heals, and take Dal with full mana. Loot his skull.
C 1033 | Come back down to the road and follow it east to Iris Lake, north of the road. Elune's Tear lies on the small island in the lake (46.4, 46.4): pick one up.
T 1024 | Shael'dryn stands at the moonwell further east, north of the road (53.5, 46.2)
A 1026 | Shael'dryn. Keep this one: the rod pieces are for the second Ashenvale trip (segment 13).
T 1054 | Back to Astranaar: Raene Wolfrunner
T 1033 | Pelturas Whitemoon
A 1034 | Pelturas Whitemoon

# ---------- South of Astranaar: Stardust, Silverwind Refuge ----------
C 1034 | Leave Astranaar and go south. The Ruins of Stardust are on the island in the lake south of town (33.3, 67.8): pick 5 Handfuls of Stardust from the Stardust Covered Bushes.
A 1016 | Go east along the south side of the zone, past the mouth of the Talondeep Path, to Silverwind Refuge on the shore of Mystral Lake. Sentinel Velene Starstrike is there (49.8, 67.2).
C 1016 @ Ashenvale, 49.0, 70.4 | Befouled Water Elementals (23-25) walk in and around Mystral Lake. Kill them for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then right-click the Divining Scroll she gave you to make the Divined Scroll.
T 1016 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
A 1017 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
C 1025 @ Ashenvale, 53.3, 62.0 | The Foulweald furbolgs live in Greenpaw Village, north-east of Silverwind Refuge (49-58, 60-65). Kill 1 Den Watcher, 2 Ursas (both 24-25, in the middle of the village), 10 Totemics and 12 Warriors (23-24). Bash the Totemics before they heal, kill whatever they plant on the ground, and pull from the edge so you fight two at most (Entangling Roots on the second).
C 1017 @ Ashenvale, 49.0, 70.4 | Sarilus Foulborne (25) stands on the island in the middle of Mystral Lake. Clear the elementals near the island, then fight him with full mana: Bash his casts, and put Entangling Roots on a summoned servant if he has one with him. Loot his head. (Questie files him under a Barrens map position; the lake is where the quest sends you.)
T 1017 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
A 98027 | Only if you are level 25, otherwise press Skip here and on its hand-in. A Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies on the ground east of Mystral Lake (63.0, 71.5): clicking it starts a level 29 quest (new in Forever). The woods out there are above your level: go in Cat Form with Prowl, take the pendant and leave.

# ---------- Talondeep Path -> Windshear Crag ----------
T 1070 | Go back west to the Talondeep Path, the tunnel in the southern cliffs (entrance at Ashenvale 42.3, 71.0), and run through it into the Stonetalon Mountains. You come out in Windshear Crag. Kaela Shadowspear watches the valley from its south-west side (59.9, 66.8).
A 1085 | Kaela Shadowspear
T 1085 | Gaxim Rustfizzle, a few steps from her
A 1071 | Gaxim Rustfizzle
A 1093 | Ziz Fizziks, in the small hut a little north (59.0, 62.6)
C 1071,1093 | The Venture Co. camps fill Windshear Crag north-east of here. Kill 10 Loggers (18-19) and 10 Deforesters (19-20), and Operators (19-20, around the machines) until one drops the Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints.
A 1090 | Piznik stands at the back of the Windshear Mine, the kobold mine in the south-east wall of the crag (71.9, 60.0). Kill the Windshear kobolds (20-22) on the way in.
C 1090 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 71.9, 60.0 | Piznik starts mining and kobolds attack in waves until he is done. Stand at the tunnel in front of him, go Bear Form when a wave arrives (Demoralizing Roar, Swipe; Entangling Roots does not work inside the mine), and heal between waves. He must survive.
T 1090 | Piznik
A 1092 | Piznik
T 1092,1093 | Ziz Fizziks. Do not take Further Instructions (it sends you to Ratchet).
T 1071 | Gaxim Rustfizzle. Do not take An Old Colleague (it sends you to Ironforge and Stormwind).

# ---------- Mirkfallon Lake and Stonetalon Peak ----------
A 86574 | Follow the road west and then north through the mountains to Mirkfallon Lake. On the way it passes below Sun Rock Retreat, a Horde town (Classic knowledge): stay on the road and do not go up the side path. The body of the Night Elf Courier lies at the lake (48.6, 39.8): Stonetalon Supply Run (new in Forever).
C 86574,1134 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 50.6, 43.0 | Pridewing wyverns fly all around Mirkfallon Lake: Wyverns (21-22), Consorts (22-23) and Skyhunters (23-24). Kill them for 12 Pridewing Venom Sacs and 6 Stonetalon Supply Bundles (the new quest's bundles come from the same wyverns). Cure Poison removes their poison (Abolish Poison from level 26). Leave the Pridewing Patriarch (25, rare elite) alone.
T 86574 | Take the road north from the lake up to Stonetalon Peak. Innkeeper Faralia is in the inn (35.7, 5.8).
T 1056 | Keeper Albagorm, the big Keeper of the Grove on the hill (37.1, 8.1). Do not take his follow-up.
F Stonetalon Peak @ Stonetalon Mountains, 36.4, 7.2 | Teloren, the hippogryph master

# ---------- Training in Moonglade, back to Astranaar and the boat ----------
N Cast Teleport: Moonglade | Training trip instead of the flight back: your Hearthstone is bound in Astranaar and was last used hours ago, if at all. No wish to train? Press Skip here and on the next step and just use the Hearthstone (or fly to Astranaar with Teloren).
TRAIN @ Moonglade, 52.5, 40.6 | Loganaar in Nighthaven: learn everything up to level 26 (Dash and Abolish Poison at 26). The next trainer is in Stormwind, after the Wetlands.
H Astranaar | Hearthstone back to Astranaar
T 1134 | Shindrell Swiftfire
T 1025 | Raene Wolfrunner
T 1034 | Pelturas Whitemoon
T 98027 | Maliynn, in the building next to Raene (36.6, 49.9). Press Skip if you never picked up the pendant.
FLY Auberdine | Daelyshia, at the west entrance of Astranaar
N Take the boat from Auberdine to Menethil Harbor | Check on the dock which boat it is: one pier goes to Menethil Harbor, the other to Darnassus. Raene's Cleansing stays in your log.
